      "message": "This is the likely cause of the CRC issues. The common case is that the full definition of struct trace_eval_map is now exposed. You can try this to suppress the CRCs:\n```\n#include \u003clinux/android_kabi.h\u003e\nANDROID_KABI_DECLONLY(trace_eval_map);\n```\nif that doesn\u0027t solve it, add:\n```\nANDROID_KABI_DECLONLY(static_call_mod);\n```\n\nIf that isn\u0027t enough, then you\u0027ll have to dig deeper. See documentation at https://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/kernel/abi-monitor#fixing-crc-mismatch",
